WEBVTT

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.700
Stop! I'm begging you, stop!

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:08.860
Aren't you friends?

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:10.130
Alice...

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:13.610
Could the scattered consciousness converged
and you regained a sense of self?

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:16.950
No... Alice... Please find Alice!

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.310
You're not Alice?!

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.000
No way... Jennifer?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:21.870
What?!

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:28.060
A year after I sent you to the exile ship,
Jennifer used the MT System and Mind Tranced.

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:32.470
The destination was the fragment of Orichalt that was left after Alice warped.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.260
Inside the Orichalt itself?

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:38.490
Yeah... To look for Alice in the sea of Orichalt.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.530
Even knowing that she could
never return to this world.

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.160
Addams! So you knew about it?!

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.730
Of course I knew.
I'm the one who helped her.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:49.480
Addams!

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:50.470
Kain!

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.810
Don't you understand?

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:55.860
That was her wish, the desire to help her grant it is only natural!

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.580
Back then, I wish I had the means
to bring Alice back.

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.540
Did you know that Jennifer loved you?

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:08.460
Yes, you, Kain, who called
Alice "extra baggage".

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.490
Humans are really baffling.

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:14.760
Just how unscientific can the heart be?

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:20.180
And yet, nevertheless,
I love the species called "humans"!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.520
Humanity will admire me!

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:30.450
I've told you already!

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:34.170
Rajeev can react and learn!
Stop the attack!

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:35.960
In the end, you still say the same thing!

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.750
The Kain inside of you wants this,
doesn't he?!

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.200
A future where 90% of humanity is destroyed!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:41.990
Don't be stupid!

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:44.110
I've never said such a thing!

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:45.450
Then what do you suggest?!

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:48.620
Not an attack!
We need acknowledgment!

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.540
You're so irritating...

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:02.520
Even after becoming this lump
of iron, you still piss me off.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.540
Mr. Ido! Is Alice safe?

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:47.960
Yeah. She's sleeping now.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.080
From what I've seen, the
federation army's in shambles.

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:55.680
That's right. Their trump card, the battle system, didn't work against Rajeev.

00:03:55.680 --> 00:03:57.010
What do we do now?

00:03:57.010 --> 00:04:03.600
If we want to live, let's jump to a habitable planet
and throw away the Orichalt once we're there.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.220
And then we keep living on that planet...

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.060
Well, that's fine, too.

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:08.400
Huh?

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:11.110
As long as I have Amanza,
that's good enough.

00:04:11.110 --> 00:04:12.030
Huh?

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.200
He's spouting nonsense again.

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:16.740
Hmm? Uh, yeah.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.450
Huh?

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.190
No way?!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.130
What is it?

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:20.720
I'll tell you later.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:24.250
Anyway, everyone's fine with
finding a new home, right?

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.330
I'm staying.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:26.790
In the Earth space?

00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:30.710
Why? At this rate Earth will
be swallowed up by Rajeev.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:35.260
There are people whose life went
crazy because of my former self.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:36.430
Even Fa-Loser.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:40.290
Fa-Loser? Did you do something?

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:45.190
Originally, it was used by Kain
as experimental animal #4.

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:49.690
So Kain was the one who turned you into this.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.270
And I'll atone for that sin...

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:57.750
Seems like it forgives you?

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:58.780
Are you sure?

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.470
That's right! Mr. Ido is Mr. Ido!

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:03.040
You're not Kain Arisugawa.

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:07.200
Nevertheless, he exists inside of me.
I want to bear this responsibility.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.200
What're you achieving by staying here?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.030
You're not planning to die, I hope?

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:13.660
You should just come with us.

00:05:13.660 --> 00:05:15.310
Everyone... I'm sorry.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:18.800
The probability is extremely low,
but there is one countermeasure...

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.640
Kain...

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:20.470
No way!

00:05:20.470 --> 00:05:23.180
Alice... just spoke!

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:27.140
You're Kain, right?

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:28.280
Jennifer?

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.230
Yes.

00:05:29.480 --> 00:05:30.560
Jennifer?

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:35.110
Jennifer Record. The co-developer of
the MT System who disappeared.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.260
Kain... Alice is nearby.

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.060
Nearby?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.720
Alice's consciousness...

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:45.290
Hey! What do you mean,
Alice is nearby?

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.830
Oh! Density of states!

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:52.000
I see... Orichalt and Rajeev have gathered here.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:56.170
And the consciousness of Alice that was scattered
across Orichalt space has been collected?

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:59.090
If the missing fragments of
Alice have returned, then...

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:01.760
It may be small, but we've got a chance.

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:07.230
It's larger than an M3 class now.

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:13.150
Even if we fire all of the remaining Orichalt missiles, it would be impossible to transfer that much mass.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:17.490
We're establishing a defensive perimeter
using geosynchronous satellites, but

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:19.860
we can't do anything against
something of that size.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:24.660
Tell every ship to dismantle the missiles and extract the Orichalt.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:25.700
Yes, Ma'am!

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:29.630
We'll use this Orichalt to create an escape route for humanity.

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:31.880
It's too early to fall into despair!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:32.820
It's no use!

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.800
At this point we have to abandon
Earth and evacuate!

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:37.530
Retreat is inexcusable!

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:39.420
I won't allow it!

00:06:39.420 --> 00:06:42.260
Ah, humans! Humanity!

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:47.560
I will Mind Trance into Rajeev myself
and stop its activity personally!

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:53.520
The planetary battle station is advancing to the breach made by those plasma diggers and the explosions.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.690
Is he planning to fly towards its center?

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:59.290
If I don't protect humanity here and now...

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:02.910
Then for what purpose was I?!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:11.710
Please... I beg you, let me complete my life!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:17.990
<i>Alice... It was a long-awaited reunion,
but I've done something unforgivable. </i>

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:18.880
<i>Please forgive me.</i>

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:24.800
<i>Ah, Kain! You're there, too? Within the world locked inside Orichalt?</i>

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.440
A message to all dispatched fleets.

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:33.020
As of this moment, the operation is halted.

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:34.920
All ships, prepare to retreat-

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:36.940
Detecting an imminent gravity wave in front!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.190
There's more coming?!

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:41.250
It's not Rajeev! It's...

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:44.060
The wanted mining spaceship!

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:44.960
What?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:48.200
The ship that just Miguel
Jumped has returned?

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:51.270
Sorry for intruding into your
channel all of a sudden.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:54.130
I'm the CEO of Escavate, Grayman.

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:58.210
And also the retired captain of the Planetary
Federation army, Jake Hojo.

00:07:58.210 --> 00:08:00.010
Hojo? You mean that one?

00:08:00.010 --> 00:08:01.630
That's right.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:04.240
We don't have time so I'll jump
straight to the point.

00:08:04.240 --> 00:08:09.760
Can you share with us the Orichalt in the fleet's possession, even if just a little?

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:16.190
Kain, no, our employee called Ido has an idea about how to stop the advance of Rajeev.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.740
We've sent you the details of our plan.

00:08:18.740 --> 00:08:21.030
It's a reckless strategy,
but there is no other way.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:24.320
This is probably our last chance.

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.610
I beg you.

00:08:25.610 --> 00:08:27.410
Give humanity hope!

00:08:27.410 --> 00:08:29.080
What a rare sight!

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:34.410
Do you realize how many lives were lost because of your mistake back then?

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:36.180
Yes. That's...

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:39.970
Transferring your mind into an
I-Machine and enjoying life after that...

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.640
And to entrust our destiny to you?

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:45.130
Yes. Um... I know that I've-

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:47.110
I'm his daughter, Clair Hojo.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:53.100
My father named himself Grayman because
he already considers himself dead!

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:58.180
I didn't have a mother and dad transferred
his mind into an I-Machine to raise me.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.400
It was not out of selfishness!
That's the truth!

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:05.170
Dad... Dad might not have been
an outstanding citizen, yes!

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:10.830
But the team that he created really
is outstanding, I'm sure of it!

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:14.620
Please, have faith in my father's team!

00:09:16.460 --> 00:09:20.290
I am the admiral of the federation army,
Cecilia Ginney.

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:27.800
According to the reports, many of the team
that your father created are criminals.

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:33.130
There is even someone without an ID number among them.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.810
By all rights, you should have
been arrested on the spot-

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.800
Before that, take a look at the plan!

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.520
And who might you be?

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:41.730
Mikuri Maya, I'm on the wanted list.

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.240
You mentioned someone without an ID...
you mean our Mr. Ido, right?

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.000
More reason, then, to take a look at the plan!

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.830
It was made by someone society
doesn't even think exists!

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:55.370
Do you understand? He didn't have
to go to the trouble of making it!

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:58.830
I mean, everyone is telling him
that he doesn't exist!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.350
But... Mr. Ido is right here!

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.710
He's alive!

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:04.710
And everyone here, I'm...!

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:05.800
Huh?

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:16.700
Well, we told them, at least.
The ball's on their side now.

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.420
I wonder what they will decide.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:21.350
There's nothing to hope for,
if you think normally.

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:24.940
You're right. They're probably looking at the plan in astonishment.

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:28.900
Since it's basically Mind Trance
into Orichalt and pray.

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:32.070
It's not written so bluntly, though.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:36.680
So what will they do? The army needs
Orichalt for their retreat, too...

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:40.180
I believe...that humanity won't give up!

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:42.920
Uh, why are you laughing?

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:44.950
Man...  Unbelievable!

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:47.190
Miss Maya was absolutely correct.

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:48.970
Huh?

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:54.540
The plan is accepted.

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:58.680
I've approved it and gave orders to the fleet.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:02.740
We're entrusting the remaining Orichalt
and humanity's future to your ship!

00:11:03.900 --> 00:11:06.980
We choose the way forward.

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:08.570
And choose to keep living.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:10.990
Admiral...

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:12.910
I expect great results from you!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:14.820
Roger that!

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:31.540
Message to all ships.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:31.740
Protect the mining ship Stulti
with all of your firepower.
Message to all ships.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:35.850
Protect the mining ship Stulti
with all of your firepower.

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:38.770
Well, chaps! Don't you dare
get carried away and die!

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.260
Are you ready?

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:40.830
Yeah.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.110
Ready and dandy!

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:43.390
All prepared.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:44.230
How's Karla?

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.610
It's a fresh body, but I'll manage.

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:50.160
All right, Clair!
Look after their bodies!

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:52.320
I know, leave it to me.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:55.080
I'll make sure to maintain the Mind Out range.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.250
Fa-Loser! Please keep Clair safe!

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:02.120
20 seconds until we begin the operation.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:06.350
To think us diggers would have
to save humanity...

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:10.470
In exchange for being pardoned.
Can't shirk this job.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:13.040
Alice! No, Jennifer.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:17.350
Alice's remaining consciousness is within
the Orichalt collected by Rajeev, right?

00:12:17.560 --> 00:12:19.270
Yes. I'm sure.

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:22.190
It's time! Stulti, launch!

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:37.210
Set the quadrant and fire all Orichalt missiles!

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:38.720
Command to all fleets.

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:41.250
Begin the operation.
I repeat, begin the operation.

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.510
Launch the Orichalt missiles.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.720
Let's plunge into the hole the army dug for us!

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:54.720
Shoot the rocks blocking our
way with Orichalt warheads!

00:12:54.720 --> 00:12:57.400
Stulti has infiltrated Rajeev.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:59.980
Depth of the crust until
target point: 8,000 meters.

00:12:59.980 --> 00:13:02.150
Will they have enough Orichalt missiles?

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:03.330
Maya!

00:13:03.330 --> 00:13:04.030
On it!

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:10.910
Good. Now we just use what
Addams dug out...

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:13.830
No way!
It's shifting the crust itself?

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.500
3,000 meters left!
Break it!

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:17.910
Roger! Amanda, dear, you too!

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:19.290
Be quiet!

00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:29.620
Crust depth, 4,000 meters!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.140
Only 2,000 meters left!

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:33.540
We're cutting it real close with
our remaining missiles

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:33.970
Hm?

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.770
Dammit!
It's shooting boulders at us!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:40.850
We won't get anywhere like this!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:44.020
We'll have to use all of them after all!

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:48.530
Please, let them reach the target depth...

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:55.120
500 meters left!

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:57.410
The crust is moving again!
We're gonna hit it!

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.580
All right, got it!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.290
Our last resort to break through.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.210
Everyone, get away from the ship!

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.160
See ya, Stulti.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.840
Release the Orichalt.

00:14:19.810 --> 00:14:21.900
Let's go! We're almost at
the destination!

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:23.110
Look out!

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.180
Miss Karla!

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:24.920
Karla!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.820
I'm fine. I'll just Mind Out.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:29.650
Ido, find Alice!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:33.990
Don't stop! Hurry!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:35.490
Ms. Amanza!

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:41.530
Welcome back.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:43.210
I wanted to last a bit longer, but...

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:46.640
Good work. Now we put our hopes
in the remaining members.

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.240
Yahoo! So thrilling!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:52.270
That's it! Right now I feel alive!

00:14:53.010 --> 00:14:55.620
Admiral Ginney, this is Clair Hojo.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.260
They've reached the target depth.

00:14:57.590 --> 00:15:00.100
So this is the core of Rajeev.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:11.020
You've brought us far enough.
Now it's up to the two of us.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.220
Don't say that, let us at least back you up!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:14.620
Let them do as they want.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.370
It's Ido's resolve.

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:23.230
Mr. Ido, just in case you become an Orillian,
make sure you don't lose yourself.

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:31.150
I can exist as myself because Rick, you and
everyone here acknowledged me as Ido.

00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:33.680
That's why I'll keep being Ido.

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.340
Please come back.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:36.840
I'll try my best.

00:15:36.840 --> 00:15:37.930
Let's go, Jennifer!

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:38.720
Yes!

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:41.020
Make sure to return!

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:42.560
Mind Out!

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:49.850
If Jennifer transferred into
the Orichalt, then I, too...

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:01.320
So this is the space inside Orichalt.

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:03.880
An Orillian with nothing but consciousness.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.550
Acknowledge myself.

00:16:07.010 --> 00:16:12.380
Who am I? Identification...
Who am I?!

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.430
What was I called?!

00:16:15.190 --> 00:16:16.960
What was I?!

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:19.730
Kain?

00:16:22.930 --> 00:16:24.850
Alice? Is that you, Alice?

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:26.770
Yeah.

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:30.820
But I'm not Kain. I'm Ido.

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:33.270
My friends call me Ido.

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:34.190
Ido?

00:16:34.190 --> 00:16:36.340
Yes. That's right.

00:16:36.340 --> 00:16:37.740
We finally meet.

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:38.980
Ido...

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:41.250
Ido...

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:46.870
Unbelievable. So you've also
Mind Tranced here?

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:51.380
Thank you. Thanks to your coming here, I was able to recognize myself.

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:52.750
Addams.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:54.510
So we've reached the same conclusion.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.430
As we are now, we can access Rajeev even
in this assimilated crystallized form.

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:03.200
I will fulfill that duty.

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:07.030
Now, Alice, please open the
communication gate to Rajeev.

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:09.310
So we can order it to stop.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:09.980
No!

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:11.430
You're wrong, Addams.

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:14.260
That's not what I came here for.

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:14.970
Huh?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.500
It's to reunite Alice and Jennifer.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.070
To regain what was lost.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.240
What're you saying?

00:17:21.240 --> 00:17:23.300
I'm going to make Rajeev learn this.

00:17:23.300 --> 00:17:24.660
Humanity's consciousness.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:29.010
You want to teach human love
to an unknown entity?

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:31.150
I'm not that much of a romantic.

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.540
Control or destruction will only be effective!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.670
You're wrong.

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:38.220
We just need it to acknowledge
humanity as part of its consciousness.

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:41.140
But can you say Rajeev will stop
after acknowledging us, Kain?!

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:42.970
Kain Arisugawa!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:45.350
Always thinking only you
have all the answers!

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:46.560
And it's the same now!

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:50.140
Why didn't you dodge?

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:51.150
Fight already!

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:53.260
Don't you hate me?!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:54.900
Don't you want to kill me?!

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:56.150
I do hate you.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:18:00.660
You changed my life, I'm in this body because of you, I do hate you!

00:18:00.660 --> 00:18:01.160
Well?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:02.550
Even so, I can't!

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:07.230
The memories of Kain Arisugawa within
me are telling me not to shoot you.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.920
Even now you're trying to pity me?!

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:12.380
Stop this!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.840
Let's stop this, Addams.

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:18.050
Mama!

00:18:18.670 --> 00:18:19.380
Alice!

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:20.340
Addams!

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.840
Jennifer! You know, don't you?!

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:24.130
Kain's true nature!

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:28.560
Addams, now that you came here,
you must have understood it, too.

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:31.730
The Kain you're looking for
doesn't exist no more.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.690
No matter what you do, it won't reach Kain.

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:35.980
You're lying!

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:37.690
Isn't Kain right here?!

00:18:37.690 --> 00:18:41.740
For me, Kain Arisugawa is my closest stranger.

00:18:43.570 --> 00:18:44.440
Right...

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.840
Kain is... gone.

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.160
Alice!

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.290
Mama!

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:54.040
Alice! I wanted to find you so much!

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:58.300
I wanted to find you, too!
Don't leave me!

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:03.380
Of course I won't! We'll always stay together from now on. Always.

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:08.600
Thank you, Ido, for letting me
meet my mother.

00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:12.520
I'm sorry. Because the system
was incomplete at the time...

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:14.770
No, I'm grateful.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:19.710
Without the Mind Trance System, I wouldn't
have been able to reunite with Alice like this...

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:27.700
Let's go, Addams. Come with us.

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:31.380
Please wait, I still have things
to discuss with him...

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.070
What's happening?

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.550
Clair, we're using the Orichalt to escape!

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:45.260
No way, Mr. Ido's still-

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:49.840
Woah, it's shining.

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:52.230
Mr. Ido... Where's Mr. Ido?!

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:55.270
Picking up Maya's, Rick's
and dad's transponders.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.230
What about Ido?

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:56.940
Nothing yet.

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:04.780
Rajeev has started to move.
It's going away from us.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:07.800
They succeeded in accessing it?

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:11.890
I don't know, but looks like
it's definitely leaving.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:18.760
Mr. Ido! Mr. Ido, come back!
You said you would! You said...

00:20:25.020 --> 00:20:26.180
Mr. Ido!

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:27.660
Ido! Wake up!

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:28.740
Ido!

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.970
No use, he's still in Mind Out.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:34.870
No way... Mr. Ido!

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:38.770
Mr. Ido! Mr. Ido!

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.330
That voice... Is that Mikuri Maya?

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.990
This is where we part. Head back.

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:47.950
Back to the world where you're called.

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:50.660
But this is my responsibility, too.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:54.600
It's not. You're not Kain, after all.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:58.190
That's why you can't stay here.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:02.210
Thanks for everything... Ido.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:10.390
Mr. Ido!

00:21:10.390 --> 00:21:11.270
Ido, my boy!

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:12.250
Ido!

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:14.430
Where's Alice?

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:15.600
Where's Addams?

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.180
Looks like they're leaving.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:36.350
So... Rajeev is safe now, right?

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:38.170
I wonder about that.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:45.300
At least it must have learned there are others inside
this universe besides the civilization that made it.

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:53.600
Everyone... You did a good job today.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:55.140
Well done!

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:23.190
Grayman, let's make the next
digging point Lambda-23.

00:23:23.190 --> 00:23:25.400
Huh? But there's...

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:28.810
There's a way in, according
to Maya. It's worth trying.

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:32.700
Oh, that sounds fantastic!
Go and kill yourself, Ido!

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:35.550
Haha, sure!
